@startuml View My Messages - Sequence Diagram

actor Customer
participant "MyMessagesController" as MsgCtrl
participant "ContactMessage" as Message
participant "MessageReply" as Reply
participant "View" as View

Customer -> MsgCtrl: index()
MsgCtrl -> Message: where(email, user->email)->with(replies)
Message --> MsgCtrl: messages
MsgCtrl -> Reply: where(is_read_by_user, false)->count()
Reply --> MsgCtrl: unread_count
MsgCtrl -> View: show my-messages.index(messages, unread_count)
View --> Customer: display messages list

@enduml
